---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="hero__label">Slow living, steeped in tea</p>
    <h1 class="hero__title">차로 하루를<br />편집하는 사람</h1>
    <p class="hero__desc">티 소믈리에가 동양철학과 개인적 시선으로 재구성한 차 이야기</p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#latest">최근 글 보기</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href={`${base}/about`}>소개</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 96px 0 64px;
  }

  .hero__label {
    font-family: var(--font-label);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .hero__title {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .hero__desc {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .hero__actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
  }
</style>
